# Prepare a release

This repository publishes releases with [Release Planner](https://github.com/fabricahq/release-planner) {{.Version}}. Print its release procedure and follow it:

```sh
release-planner guide
```

First check that `release-planner version` prints `{{.Version}}`. If it doesn't, or `release-planner` isn't installed, install that version:

```sh
{{.Install}}
```

Read `{{.PolicyPath}}` first for this repository's release policy. You prepare the release pull request; the maintainer approves the release by merging it. Never tag, publish, or merge.
